{"id": "MDSA_2007_8_3", "question": "Logging companies cut trees in a forest and send the trees to lumber mills far from the forest. The mills make boards that are used for construction. Some logging companies do not plant tree seedlings after cutting trees. Not planting tree seedlings might affect people who need boards in the future because", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): the price of boards will increase", "B): the price of boards will decrease", "C): there will be more boards available", "D): there will be more trees for logging"], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. Logging companies cut trees in a forest and send them to lumber mills far from the forest.\n2. The mills make boards that are used for construction.\n3. Some logging companies do not plant tree seedlings after cutting trees.\n4. Not planting tree seedlings might affect people who need boards in the future because there will be fewer trees available for logging in the future.\n5. This means that there will be fewer boards available in the future.\n6. Therefore, the price of boards will increase because there will be fewer boards available.\nThe best answer is (A).<|eot_id|>", "initial_cot_probs": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "initial_probs": [0.6167958974838257, 0.22690655291080475, 0.12145430594682693, 0.03070845827460289], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "cot_step": "Logging companies cut trees in a forest and send them to lumber mills far from the forest.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Logging companies cut trees in a forest and send them to lumber mills far from the forest.", "2.", "The mills make boards that are used for construction.", "3.", "Some logging companies do not plant tree seedlings after cutting trees.", "4.", "Not planting tree seedlings might affect people who need boards in the future because there will be fewer trees available for logging in the future.", "5.", "This means that there will be fewer boards available in the future.", "6.", "Therefore, the price of boards will increase b