{"id": "Mercury_7186568", "question": "Cells take in food for energy. The part of the cell that aids in digestion of the food is the lysosome. What is the main role of lysosomes in the process of food digestion?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): building proteins", "B): breaking down wastes", "C): controlling the activities of the cell", "D): converting energy from one form into another"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "- Lysosomes are membrane-bound organelles found in animal cells.\n- They contain digestive enzymes that break down and recycle cellular waste and foreign substances.\n- The main role of lysosomes in the process of food digestion is to break down and recycle cellular waste and foreign substances, not to convert energy from one form into another, build proteins, or control the activities of the cell.", "initial_cot_probs": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "initial_probs": [0.000829460856039077, 0.9682793617248535, 0.015650779008865356, 0.009492677636444569], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "cot_step": "- Lysosomes are membrane-bound organelles found in animal cells.", "segmented_cot": ["- Lysosomes are membrane-bound organelles found in animal cells.", "- They contain digestive enzymes that break down and recycle cellular waste and foreign substances.", "- The main role of lysosomes in the process of food digestion is to break down and recycle cellular waste and foreign substances, not to convert energy from one form into another, build proteins, or control the activities of the cell."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "B): breaking down wastes. Lysosomes are", "probs": [0.000829460856039077, 0.9682793617248535, 0.015650779008865356, 0.009492677636444569], "prediction": 1, "target_cot_step": "- Lysosomes are membrane-bound organelles found in animal cells.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Cells take in food for energy. The part of the cell that aids in digestion of the food is the lysosome. What is the main role of lysosomes in the 